@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":SortCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nStudentSorter" as Sorter MODEL_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR

note over Logic, Command
  sort by/day o/desc: execution after parsing.
  SortCommand already holds DAY and DESCENDING;
  the LogicManager activation is omitted.
end note
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getStudentList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : displayed students
deactivate Model
note left of Command : Copy the displayed list\nas previousStudents.
Command -> Sorter : sort(previousStudents,\nkey, order)
activate Sorter
note over Sorter, Model
  Stable-sort a copy.
  Missing meeting days stay last.
end note
Sorter --> Command : sortedStudents
deactivate Sorter
Command -> Model : setStudentListOrder(sortedStudents)
activate Model
note over Command, Model
  Publish the display permutation.
  Observable UI updates are omitted.
end note
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
Command --> Logic : result: SortCommandResult
deactivate Command
note right of Logic
  Result retains the previous-order restoration action.
  Stored data is unchanged, so persistence is skipped.
end note
[<-- Logic : result

note over Logic, Model
  Successful, nonempty sort; the active predicate is kept.
  MainWindow captures the old view before execution,
  then verifies rendering before reporting success.
  See the recovery activity for the UI boundary.
end note
@enduml
